      "name": "overview",
      "value": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "name": "privacy_overview",
      "value": "Lumio Music is a fully offline local music player. Your songs, favorites, playlists and settings are all stored on your device. It offers no cloud service, requires no account, and integrates no third-party SDK. Except for cast on your LAN and third-party web links you open yourself, the app never sends your data to any external server."
    },
    {
      "name": "info_collected",
      "value": "Information we collect"
    },
    {
      "name": "info_collected_desc",
      "value": "We collect no personally identifiable information. The “library” you see comes only from local audio files you import; the app only reads and shows their metadata: title, artist, album, duration. Favorites, playlists, playback and theme settings are generated by your local actions and stored only on this device. We never collect your location, device identifiers, account or browsing behavior."
    },
    {
      "name": "storage_location",
      "value": "Where data is stored"
    },
    {
      "name": "storage_location_desc",
      "value": "All the data above is stored in the app’s sandboxed local directory (Preferences and files), isolated from other apps and accessible only by this app. It is never uploaded to any server and never leaves your device. Uninstalling the app deletes the local sandbox data."
    },
    {
      "name": "permissions_title",
      "value": "Permissions"
    },
    {
      "name": "perm_intro",
      "value": "This app only requests the following permissions:\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "perm_bg",
      "value": "• Background run (KEEP_BACKGROUND_RUNNING): to keep playing music after lock screen or leaving the app.\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "perm_internet",
      "value": "• Network access (INTERNET): only to (1) cast local audio over your LAN to a device you choose, and (2) open third-party web pages like the developer site via the system browser when you tap those entries. We never use it to upload your music or personal data."
    },
    {
      "name": "cast_title",
      "value": "Cast (LAN) transfer"
    },
    {
      "name": "cast_desc",
      "value": "Cast uses the system AVSessionKit AVCastController to send the local audio playing on your device over your LAN (Wi-Fi) to a device you choose (e.g. speaker / TV). Transfer stays on your LAN, never via the cloud, and only starts when you tap cast and pick a device."
    },
    {
      "name": "third_party_title",
      "value": "Third-party links"
    },
    {
      "name": "third_party_desc",
      "value": "In entries like Settings - About Developer, the app provides a link to https://www.a703201sworld.top/resume/ (developer site). Tapping only opens it in the system browser; the app doesn’t embed it or send it your data. That site is run by a third party and handles its own privacy."
    },
    {
      "name": "logs_title",
      "value": "Logs and desensitization"
    },
    {
      "name": "logs_desc",
      "value": "We have hardened logging: media file paths and song titles that could appear in system logs now go through Logger’s *Private interface to be desensitized, so logs never contain paths that identify your files or recognizable song titles, and no personal info is recorded."
    },
    {
      "name": "commitment_title",
      "value": "Our commitment"
    },
    {
      "name": "commitment_desc",
      "value": "We do none of the following: no cloud sync / storage; no sharing, selling or transferring your data to any third party; no third-party SDK that collects info; no ads; no tracking, analytics or behavior profiling; no account required; no personal data collected."
    },
    {
      "name": "rights_title",
      "value": "Your rights and contact"
    },
    {
      "name": "rights_desc",
      "value": "You fully control your local data: in Settings you can clear cache, clear listening stats and turn off features; uninstalling the app deletes all local data.\n"
    },
    {
      "name": "contact_hint",
      "value": "If you have questions or want to exercise your rights, contact:\n"
